message: "Please cite this software and its accompanying main-results report when using VisDSR."
type: software
title: "VisDSR: Evaluating DSU Reasoning from Text and Diagrams"
authors:
  - given-names: Abhishek
    family-names: R P
version: v2.0-results
date-released: 2026-10-06
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abhishekgit01/VisDSR"
url: "https://github.com/Abhishekgit01/VisDSR/releases/tag/v2.0-results"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible evaluation of disjoint-set union reasoning across text,
  rendered text, and forest diagrams. The frozen main study contains 80
  paired tasks, five conditions, and 800 independent Qwen3-VL and
  InternVL3.5 responses. Raw responses, exact scoring, paired analysis,
  and the report are supplied; low accuracy limits modality conclusions.
